 **Inputs and Outputs**
-*   **Input:** An absorbance field (voxel grid defining extinction coefficients), a set of emitter clusters (groups of light facets or the entire light source for distant receivers), and a receiver position.
-*   **Output:** The optical depth $\tau$ from the emitter cluster to the receiver position, derived from the transmittance volume.
